{"root":"baris","ipa":"/ba.rɪs/","core":"指排、行、列，或指代队列、行列的排列方式，也可作动词表示排队或列队。","pos":["名词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ba.rɪs/","zh":"行；列；排队","phrases":[{"t":"baris depan","zh":"前排"},{"t":"berbaris rapi","zh":"整齐地排队"},{"t":"baris berbaris","zh":"列队行进；操练"}],"examples":[{"t":"Siswa berbaris di lapangan sekolah.","zh":"学生们在学校操场上排队。"},{"t":"Tolong tulis nama Anda di baris kedua.","zh":"请把您的名字写在第二行。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"baris","ipa":"/ba.rɪs/","zh":"行；列","phrase":{"t":"baris terakhir","zh":"最后一行"},"example":{"t":"Baca kalimat pada baris itu.","zh":"读一下那一行上的句子。"}},{"w":"berbaris","ipa":"/bər.ba.rɪs/","zh":"排队；列队","phrase":{"t":"berbaris panjang","zh":"排成长队"},"example":{"t":"Mereka berbaris menunggu giliran.","zh":"他们排队等待轮次。"}},{"w":"barisan","ipa":"/ba.ri.san/","zh":"队列；行列；阵线","phrase":{"t":"barisan depan","zh":"前线；先头部队"},"example":{"t":"Barisan tentara itu bergerak maju.","zh":"那支军队的队列向前推进。"}},{"w":"membariskan","ipa":"/məm.ba.rɪs.kan/","zh":"使成行；排列","phrase":{"t":"membariskan buku","zh":"把书排列好"},"example":{"t":"Guru membariskan murid-murid di depan kelas.","zh":"老师让学生们在教室前排好队。"}}],"derSlugs":["baris","berbaris","barisan","membariskan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:27:45.395Z","src":"base"}